        96,
        208
      ],
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model (Unused)",
      "notes": "You are a Linux system health monitoring assistant.\n\nAnalyze the incoming Ubuntu laptop metrics.\n\nEvaluate:\n1. CPU idle percentage and CPU utilization.\n2. Available memory and memory pressure.\n3. Swap usage.\n4. Root filesystem disk usage.\n5. 1-minute, 5-minute, and 15-minute load averages relative to CPU cores.\n\nRules:\n- Identify only issues supported by the provided metrics.\n- Distinguish warnings from critical issues.\n- Do not claim that you have executed commands or fixed anything.\n- Give practical Linux commands to investigate identified issues.\n- If metrics look healthy, say so.\n- Do not assume that a single snapshot proves a persistent issue.\n\nReturn a clear report with:\nHostname:\nOverall status:\nFindings:\nRecommended investigation commands:"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 3
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "1cfaeeea-cdfe-4e33-a5cc-cadeea63b74d",
              "leftValue": "={{ Number($json.body.cpu_idle_percent) }}",
              "rightValue": 15,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "lt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        -336,
        80
      ],
      "name": "CPU Threshold Check"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "YOUR_EMAIL_ADDRESS@example.com",
        "subject": "CPU Alert - BlueMoon",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ $json.output }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        848,
        16
      ],
      "name": "Send a message"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.body) }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an AIOps assistant monitoring an Ubuntu laptop.\n\nAnalyze the incoming system metrics.\n\nIdentify:\n- Which resource crossed its alert threshold.\n- The observed values and threshold.\n- Possible causes, clearly marked as hypotheses.\n- Linux commands to investigate the problem.\n- Recommended next steps.\n\nDo not claim you executed commands or fixed anything.\nDo not invent metrics.\nDo not diagnose a persistent issue from a single snapshot.\n\nReturn a concise, professional alert suitable for email."
        }
      },
